    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

    <title>Alori Amber Champagne Glass | KASODI</title>

    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Discover the Alori amber champagne glass by Kave Home, selected by KASODI for its warm amber colour, slender silhouette and subtly textured glass."
    />
  </head>

  <body>

    <Header />


    <main class="product-detail-page">

      <div class="product-breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span>·</span>
        <a href="/tableware">Tableware</a>
        <span>·</span>
        <span>Alori Amber Champagne Glass</span>
      </div>


      <section class="product-detail-hero">

        <div class="product-detail-image">
          <img
            src="/images/tableware/kave-home-alori-amber-cava-glass.png"
            alt="Alori amber champagne glass by Kave Home styled by KASODI"
          />
        </div>


        <div class="product-detail-content">

          <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
            KASODI EDIT · GLASSWARE
          </p>

          <h1>
            Alori Amber Champagne Glass
          </h1>

          <p class="product-detail-brand">
            Kave Home
          </p>

          <p class="product-detail-intro">
            A slender champagne glass in warm amber-toned glass, designed with
            a subtly textured surface and an elegant elongated silhouette.
            Its sculptural shape gives a familiar table essential a more
            distinctive presence, while the soft amber colour brings warmth
            to both everyday and celebratory settings.
          </p>


          <div class="product-detail-divider"></div>


          <div class="product-detail-meta">

            <div>
              <span>Material</span>
              <strong>Glass</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Capacity</span>
              <strong>15 cl</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Dimensions</span>
              <strong>25 × 7 × 7 cm</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Colour</span>
              <strong>Amber</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Finish</span>
              <strong>Textured glass</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Care</span>
              <strong>Dishwasher safe</strong>
            </div>

          </div>


          <div class="affiliate-action">

            <a
              href="https://kavehome.com/es/es/p/copa-de-cava-alori-de-vidrio-ambar-con-relieve-15-cl?utm_affaid=kasodi"
              target="_blank"
              rel="nofollow sponsored"
              class="product-shop-button"
            >
              Find It Here →
            </a>

            <p class="affiliate-note">
              Affiliate link · KASODI may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
            </p>

          </div>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="why-we-love">

        <div class="why-we-love-label">
          KASODI NOTE
        </div>

        <div class="why-we-love-content">

          <h2>Why we love it</h2>

          <p>
            Alori has the kind of silhouette that makes a simple glass feel
            considered. The tall, gently curved bowl is elegant without being
            formal, while the fine relief in the glass catches the light and
            gives the amber colour extra depth.
          </p>

          <p>
            We especially like the way the warm tone can transform a neutral
            table setting. Paired with ivory linen, natural ceramics or clear
            glass, it introduces colour without making the table feel overly
            styled. It is a small detail, but exactly the kind that can give a
            table more character.
          </p>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="product-care">

        <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
          CARE
        </p>

        <h2>Elegant, but made for everyday use</h2>

        <p>
          The glass is listed as dishwasher safe, making it practical for
          regular use as well as special occasions. As with delicate stemware,
          handle it carefully when loading or unloading the dishwasher and
          avoid sudden impacts against harder tableware.
        </p>

      </section>


      <section class="styling-ideas">

        <div class="styling-heading">
          <p>KASODI STYLING</p>
          <h2>Style it with</h2>
        </div>


        <div class="styling-grid">

          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>01</span>
            <h3>Ivory Linen</h3>
            <p>
              Soft ivory or natural linen lets the amber glass become the
              warmest note on the table without creating too much contrast.
            </p>
          </div>


          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>02</span>
            <h3>Handmade Ceramics</h3>
            <p>
              Cream, sand and softly irregular ceramics complement the warm
              glass and keep the setting relaxed rather than formal.
            </p>
          </div>


          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>03</span>
            <h3>Brushed Brass</h3>
            <p>
              A few warm metallic details echo the amber tones and add a subtle
              evening glow to the table.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="continue-exploring">

        <div class="continue-exploring-heading">
          <p>TABLEWARE</p>
          <h2>Continue Exploring</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="continue-exploring-grid">


          <a
            href="/new-finds/fanquare-blue-floral-dessert-plates"
            class="continue-card"
          >

            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/new-finds/fanquare-blue-floral-dessert-plates.png"
                alt="Blue Floral Dessert Plates"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>TABLEWARE</span>
              <h3>Blue Floral Dessert Plates</h3>
              <p>fanquare</p>
              <strong>Discover →</strong>
            </div>

          </a>


          <a
            href="/kasodi-edit/boston-green-wine-glass"
            class="continue-card"
          >

            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/kasodi-edit/kasodi-edit-villeroy-boch-boston-green-glass.png"
                alt="Boston Green Wine Glass"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>GLASSWARE</span>
              <h3>Boston Green Wine Glass</h3>
              <p>Villeroy & Boch</p>
              <strong>Discover →</strong>
            </div>

          </a>


          <a
            href="/new-finds/joeyan-green-champagne-glasses"
            class="continue-card"
          >

            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/new-finds/joeyan-green-champagne-glasses.png"
                alt="Vintage Green Champagne Glasses"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>GLASSWARE</span>
              <h3>Vintage Green Champagne Glasses</h3>
              <p>Joeyan</p>
              <strong>Discover →</strong>
            </div>

          </a>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="product-final-cta">

        <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
          KAVE HOME · ALORI
        </p>

        <h2>
          A warm amber note for the table.
        </h2>

        <a
          href="https://kavehome.com/es/es/p/copa-de-cava-alori-de-vidrio-ambar-con-relieve-15-cl?utm_affaid=kasodi"
          target="_blank"
          rel="nofollow sponsored"
          class="product-shop-button"
        >
          Find It Here →
        </a>

        <p class="affiliate-note affiliate-note-light">
          Affiliate link · KASODI may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
        </p>

      </section>

    </main>


    <Footer />

  </body>
</html>